  "item_short_desc": "<p>Overcome extreme winter weather with our Ski and Rescue Suit. Designed to keep you warm and dry in extreme elements, these insulated snowsuits are perfect for skiing, snowmobiling, hunting, outdoor work, or any activity requiring you to spend long periods of time in cold weather.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "2715",
  "description": "<p>Overcome extreme winter weather with our Ski and Rescue Suit. Designed to keep you warm and dry in extreme elements, these insulated snowsuits are perfect for skiing, snowmobiling, hunting, outdoor work, or any activity requiring you to spend long periods of time in cold weather. Coldproof Insulation: These one-piece winter jumpsuits are lined with Hollofil 808 insulation that contains a hollow core, trapping air inside for greater warmth and loft. These waterproof snowsuits also consist of a heavy oxford nylon shell that blocks the wind, rain, and snow. Ultimate Heat Retention: Regulate your body temperature with the detachable zip-off hood and insulated collar. The drawstring hood utilizes a back zipper, allowing you to remove or reattach it as the need arises. These ski suits contain 2 lined side slash pockets for keeping your hands warm and dry. Comfortable Design: These one-piece ski suits feature a two-way front zipper that provides you with easy access from top and bottom. The front zipper also features a single snap closure for better insulation. In addition, the leg zippers allow you to put on or take off your boots with ease. These snowsuits also have a front zipper pocket for securing small items and accessories. Utility at the Forefront: The black elastic knit cuffs and belt helps retain heat by keeping the cold weather ski suit close to your body. The elastic belt is designed to have a snug and secure fit. The waterproof ski suit also features red, white, and blue stripes that run down each arm and left chest pocket.</p>",
